      "value": "2025-04-10",
      "detail": "https://vineyardgazette.com/news/2025/04/10/morrison-beats-donaroma-edgartown-select-board-seat",
      "quote": "Thursday, April 10, 2025 - 7:30pm PRINT 6 COMMENTS Alexander Morrison is headed to the Edgartown select board after beating out a longtime incumbent at Thursday’s annual town election.",
      "note": "The Vineyard Gazette datelines this story Thursday, April 10, 2025 and its first sentence calls the contest Thursday annual town election, so the dateline and the event are the same day in one span. The result matches the return we hold: Morrison beat Michael Donaroma, who received 200, and Glen Searle, who got 251. The town own elections-voting page is behind a bot filter that returns 252 characters, an interstitial and not a page, so it is UNCHECKED rather than silent; a newspaper that carries the result is a source under the standing rule that if it has the results it is used as the results."
    }
